{"game":"Memory of Goddess (NKS)","id":"story-hidden","title":"RECORD #00 STAY TOGETHER","group":"Story","count":35,"sections":[{"type":"facts","items":[["Plays in",[{"page":"stages-mog-6","label":"Challenge Stage (M.O.G.)"}]],["Play as",[{"page":"char-6","label":"RE : THE HOOD"}]],["Carrying",null]]},{"type":"table","columns":["Speaker","Line"],"rows":[["",{"img":"nks_sbg_01","size":"large"}],["",{"b":"RECORD #00\nSTAY TOGETHER"}],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Red Hood! Stop moving around!"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"What do you expect me to do? My back is itching something fierce."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"Why don't you do something about that scarf?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"I think that's the reason you're itching."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c966","caption":"Rapunzel","size":"small"},"Since we're on the subject, I'd like to ask:"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c966","caption":"Rapunzel","size":"small"},"Do you ever wash that scarf?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"Huh? What do you mean?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Gah!"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c966","caption":"Rapunzel","size":"small"},"Oh, heavens above..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"Sorry, but can someone change places with me?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c965","caption":"Scarlet","size":"small"},"No matter how pitched the fighting, one must never neglect one's personal hygiene entirely."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"Oh please, it's not that dirty. I take decent care of myself."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c965","caption":"Scarlet","size":"small"},"Hmm? The wind..."],["",{"b":"*Swoooosh*"}],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c966","caption":"Rapunzel","size":"small"},"Agh! The scarf went in my mouth!"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c965","caption":"Scarlet","size":"small"},"Hold still. I shall cleave your mouth at once... er, I mean the scarf."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"It was nice knowing you, Rapunzel."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"Oh, lay off it, will you! My scarf is clean as a whistle."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c966","caption":"Rapunzel","size":"small"},"You just admitted that you've never washed it, not even once!"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"The sunlight disinfects it just fine!"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"Based on that crackpot theory, you wouldn't ever have to wash yourself either."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"Precisely. So I don't."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c965","caption":"Scarlet","size":"small"},"..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c966","caption":"Rapunzel","size":"small"},"..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"Oh for crying out loud, I'm kidding! Why are you all so serious?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Because it sounds like something you'd do."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c470","caption":"Red Hood","size":"small"},"Get over here. You're begging for a headlock."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Ah, the camera is moving."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"It'll take a photo in 5 seconds."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Everybody looks at the camera."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"It's taking it!"],["",{"img":"nks_sbg_09","size":"large"}],["",{"b":"*Click*"}]]}]}